{
  "parents": [],
  "prev": {
    "link": "../core/",
    "title": "Core API"
  },
  "next": null,
  "title": "Memory API",
  "meta": {},
  "body": "<section id=\"memory-api\">\n<h1>Memory API<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#memory-api\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h1>\n<section id=\"module-reckon.memory.manager\">\n<span id=\"manager\"></span><h2>Manager<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-reckon.memory.manager\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h2>\n<p>Store observations under byte, slot, token and operation-rate allowances.</p>\n<p>Python holds full records and queries; the required Rust store maintains\ncompact records, priorities and a bounded event ring. Store/cache mutations\nuse a reentrant lock. Returned records remain mutable references, and callers\ncoordinate episode contexts and retrieval/observation sequences separately.\nStorage locking does not make that complete sequence atomic.</p>\n<p>Use retrieve() to track returned IDs for observe(), or read() for a query\nwithout context tracking. Preserve events before draining or resetting the\nfinite log; a saved operation alone does not preserve the full record payload.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.ReckonJSONEncoder\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ReckonJSONEncoder</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">skipkeys</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_ascii</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">check_circular</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">allow_nan</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">sort_keys</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">indent</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">separators</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">default</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.ReckonJSONEncoder\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>JSON encoder that handles common Reckon types.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Handles:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>datetime: Converted to ISO format string.</p></li>\n<li><p>dataclasses: Converted to dict via asdict().</p></li>\n<li><p>Objects with __dict__: Converted to their __dict__.</p></li>\n<li><p>Objects with tolist(): Converted to list (numpy arrays).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.ReckonJSONEncoder.default\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">default</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">o</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.ReckonJSONEncoder.default\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Convert a supported payload value to a JSON-encodable representation.</p>\n<p>Try datetime, dataclass, object attributes and tolist() in that order.\nDelegate unsupported values to JSONEncoder, which raises TypeError.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.MemoryEvent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MemoryEvent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">event_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timestamp</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">record_id</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">details=&lt;factory&gt;</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.MemoryEvent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>An event in the memory log for debugging.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>event_type</strong> (<em>str</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>timestamp</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>record_id</strong> (<em>str</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>details</strong> (<em>dict</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CausalMemoryManager</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">budget</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">retention_policy</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">episode_id</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The Causal Memory Manager (CMM).</p>\n<p>Enforces memory budgets, manages record lifecycle, and logs\nall decisions for the debugger.</p>\n<p>Uses Rust extensions for performance:\n- RecordStore: O(1) lookup, O(log n) pruning selection\n- EventLogger: High-frequency event ring buffer</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"n\">budget</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">MemoryBudget</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">max_slots</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">max_bytes</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">10000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">cmm</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">CausalMemoryManager</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">budget</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Store a record</span>\n<span class=\"n\">record_id</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">cmm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">write</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">payload</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">observation</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">payload_type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">PayloadType</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">OBSERVATION</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">tags</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"cue\"</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Retrieve records</span>\n<span class=\"n\">hits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">cmm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"tags\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"cue\"</span><span class=\"p\">]})</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Get event log for debugging</span>\n<span class=\"n\">events</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">cmm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_event_log</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>budget</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../core/#reckon.core.resources.MemoryBudget\" title=\"reckon.core.resources.MemoryBudget\"><em>MemoryBudget</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>retention_policy</strong> (<em><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy\" title=\"reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy\">RetentionPolicy</a> | None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>episode_id</strong> (<em>str</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.subscribe_events\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">subscribe_events</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.subscribe_events\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Receive source identity and each actual kernel event without draining it.</p>\n<p>Existing retained events are included atomically with subscription. An\nearlier ring overflow is refused. The subscriber must consume its queue;\nthese diagnostic copies are separate from the task’s memory budget.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><em>Iterator</em>[<em>SimpleQueue</em>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.before_read\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">before_read</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">intervention</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.before_read\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Install a trial intervention at each read’s candidate boundary.</p>\n<p>The callback sees the records the query would return, before access or\ncredit is recorded. It may prune records; the query is then resolved\nagain. The scope holds this manager’s lock, survives episode resets,\nand removes the callback even if the task raises. Callbacks must not\ninitiate another read, and nested intervention scopes are refused.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>intervention</strong> (<em>Callable[[list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]], None]</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><em>Iterator</em>[None]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.current_usage_bytes\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">current_usage_bytes</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.current_usage_bytes\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Current memory usage in bytes.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.fork_for_trial\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">fork_for_trial</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">retention_policy</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.fork_for_trial\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Copy stored memory and its timeline for an independent trial.</p>\n<p>The caller supplies a fresh trial policy. Records, costs, utilities and\nnative priorities are copied under the manager lock. The trial starts\nwith fresh operation windows and an empty event log; callbacks,\nsubscriptions and the caller’s episode context are not copied. This is\na new experiment from retained memory, not replay of an active task.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>retention_policy</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy\" title=\"reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy\"><em>RetentionPolicy</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager\" title=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager\"><em>CausalMemoryManager</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.current_usage_slots\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">current_usage_slots</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.current_usage_slots\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Current number of records stored.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.current_usage_tokens\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">current_usage_tokens</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.current_usage_tokens\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Declared tokens, or unavailable while any retained count is missing.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.set_step\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_step</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">step</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.set_step\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set an integer episode-relative step, preserving the old step on overflow.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>step</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.set_episode\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set_episode</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">episode_id</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">reset_memory</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.set_episode\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Begin an episode, optionally keeping records, scores and events.</p>\n<p>With reset_memory=False, episode-relative steps advance beyond the\nprevious episode so FIFO and LRU can order retained records correctly.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>episode_id</strong> (<em>str</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reset_memory</strong> (<em>bool</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.write\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">write</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">tags</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cost_bytes</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">source_op</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">input_ids</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">initial_utility</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">metadata</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cost_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.write\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Store a new record.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>payload</strong> (<em>Any</em>) – The data to store</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>payload_type</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.PayloadType\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.PayloadType\"><em>PayloadType</em></a>) – Type of payload</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>tags</strong> (<em>list[str] | None</em>) – Categorical tags</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>cost_bytes</strong> (<em>int | None</em>) – Integer byte count, floored at one; estimated when omitted</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>source_op</strong> (<em>str</em>) – Operation that created this record</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>input_ids</strong> (<em>list[str] | None</em>) – IDs of records this depends on</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>initial_utility</strong> (<em>float</em>) – Initial utility estimate</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>metadata</strong> (<em>dict | None</em>) – Additional metadata</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>cost_tokens</strong> (<em>int | None</em>) – Caller-counted tokens; required when a token limit is set.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The ID of the stored record</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>TypeError</strong> – The supplied byte count is not an integer.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>OverflowError</strong> – A cost or retained total exceeds the kernel’s signed 64-bit range.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.read\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">read</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">query</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">record_ids</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">limit</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">10</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.read\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Retrieve records matching query.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>query</strong> (<em>dict | None</em>) – Query dict with optional keys: tags, payload_type, min_utility</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>record_ids</strong> (<em>list[str] | None</em>) – Specific record IDs to retrieve</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>limit</strong> (<em>int</em>) – Maximum number of records to return</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List of matching records</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\"><em>MemoryRecord</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.prune\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">prune</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">record_id</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'manual'</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.prune\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Explicitly remove a record.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>record_id</strong> (<em>str</em>) – ID of record to remove</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reason</strong> (<em>str</em>) – Reason for pruning</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>True if record was found and removed</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>bool</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.update_score\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">update_score</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">record_id</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">score_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">signal_source</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.update_score\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Update causal or utility score for a record.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>record_id</strong> (<em>str</em>) – ID of record to update</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>score_type</strong> (<em>str</em>) – One of ‘utility’, ‘ablation_delta’, ‘counterfactual_delta’,\n‘influence_proxy’</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>value</strong> (<em>float</em>) – New score value</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>signal_source</strong> (<em>str</em>) – What triggered the update</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>True if record was found and updated</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>bool</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_record\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_record</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">record_id</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_record\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get a specific record by ID.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>record_id</strong> (<em>str</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\"><em>MemoryRecord</em></a> | None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_all_records\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_all_records</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_all_records\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get all records currently in memory.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\"><em>MemoryRecord</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_event_log\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_event_log</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_event_log\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the full event log for debugging.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List of event dicts from the Rust EventLogger.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[dict]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_event_log_jsonl\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_event_log_jsonl</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_event_log_jsonl\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get event log as JSON lines (for streaming to debugger).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>JSONL string of all events.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.retrieve\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">retrieve</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">query</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">record_ids</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">limit</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">10</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.retrieve\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Retrieve records and track them for credit assignment.</p>\n<p>This is the v1.0 API method that replaces read(). It tracks retrieved\nrecords in the EpisodeContext for later credit assignment via observe().</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>query</strong> (<em>dict | None</em>) – Query dict with optional keys: tags, payload_type, min_utility</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>record_ids</strong> (<em>List[str] | None</em>) – Specific record IDs to retrieve</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>limit</strong> (<em>int</em>) – Maximum number of records to return</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<em><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../core/#reckon.core.episode_context.EpisodeContext\" title=\"reckon.core.episode_context.EpisodeContext\">EpisodeContext</a> | None</em>) – EpisodeContext for tracking (uses implicit context if None)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List of matching records</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><em>List</em>[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\"><em>MemoryRecord</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">EpisodeContext</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">episode_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"ep_001\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">records</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">manager</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">retrieve</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"tags\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"cue\"</span><span class=\"p\">]})</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># ... agent uses records ...</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">credits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">manager</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">observe</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">outcome</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.observe\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">observe</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">outcome</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">policy</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">CreditPolicy.SIMPLE</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.observe\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Observe an outcome and assign credit to retrieved records.</p>\n<p>Distributes credit to records that were retrieved in the current\ncontext, then updates their utility scores.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>outcome</strong> (<em>float</em>) – Outcome value (e.g., reward, success indicator)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>policy</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../core/#reckon.core.credit.CreditPolicy\" title=\"reckon.core.credit.CreditPolicy\"><em>CreditPolicy</em></a>) – Credit assignment policy</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>context</strong> (<em><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../core/#reckon.core.episode_context.EpisodeContext\" title=\"reckon.core.episode_context.EpisodeContext\">EpisodeContext</a> | None</em>) – EpisodeContext to use (uses implicit context if None)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List of CreditAssignment objects showing credit distribution</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><em>List</em>[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../core/#reckon.core.credit.CreditAssignment\" title=\"reckon.core.credit.CreditAssignment\"><em>CreditAssignment</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">EpisodeContext</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">episode_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"ep_001\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">records</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">manager</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">retrieve</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"tags\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"cue\"</span><span class=\"p\">]})</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># ... agent uses records and gets reward ...</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">assignments</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">manager</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">observe</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">outcome</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">policy</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">CreditPolicy</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SIMPLE</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_utilities\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_utilities</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.manager.CausalMemoryManager.get_utilities\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get current utility values for all records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dict mapping record_id to utility value</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><em>Dict</em>[str, float]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-reckon.memory.record\">\n<span id=\"record-values\"></span><h2>Record values<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-reckon.memory.record\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h2>\n<p>Python behavior and object adapters for Rust-owned laboratory records.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.PayloadType\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.record.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PayloadType</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">values</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.PayloadType\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Types of payloads that can be stored in a record.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.RecordOrigin\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.record.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">RecordOrigin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">source_op</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">Ellipsis</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">input_ids</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">hash</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">Ellipsis</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.RecordOrigin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Creating operation, ordered inputs and supplied content hash.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>source_op</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>input_ids</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>hash</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.UtilityEstimate\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.record.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">UtilityEstimate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">uncertainty</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">1.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">last_used</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">Ellipsis</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">use_count</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.UtilityEstimate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Mutable utility, uncertainty and access statistics stored in Rust.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>value</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>uncertainty</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>last_used</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>use_count</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.UtilityEstimate.update_utility\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">update_utility</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">delta</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.UtilityEstimate.update_utility\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Update utility with clamped delta.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>delta</strong> (<em>float</em>) – The utility change to apply.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>True if normalization is needed (absolute value exceeds threshold).</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>bool</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.CausalScore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.record.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CausalScore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ablation_delta</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">counterfactual_delta</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">influence_proxy</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">last_evaluated</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">-1</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.CausalScore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Optional attribution measurements; absence differs from measured zero.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>ablation_delta</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>counterfactual_delta</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>influence_proxy</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>last_evaluated</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.CausalScore.is_proxy_only\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">is_proxy_only</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.CausalScore.is_proxy_only\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Whether only a proxy was supplied; zero and negative deltas remain present.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.RecordCost\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.record.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">RecordCost</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">1</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.RecordCost\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Byte and slot cost, with None for an uncounted token cost.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>bytes</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>tokens</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>slots</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.record.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MemoryRecord</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">id</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timestamp</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cost</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">tags</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">provenance</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">utility</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">causal_score</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">episode_id</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">metadata</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">compressed</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">encoding</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">created_at_step</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">created_at_sequence</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A native record retaining its caller’s payload, lists and metadata objects.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>id</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>timestamp</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>payload_type</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>payload</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>cost</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>tags</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>provenance</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>utility</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>causal_score</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>episode_id</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>metadata</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>compressed</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>encoding</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>created_at_step</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>created_at_sequence</strong> (<em>Any</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.snapshot_json\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">snapshot_json</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">metadata_bytes</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.snapshot_json\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Export a typed snapshot using caller-supplied encodings for opaque objects.</p>\n<p>Integer fields use decimal strings and unknown tokens remain null.\nThe live payload and metadata objects are never replaced or serialized implicitly.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>payload_bytes</strong> (<em>bytes</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>metadata_bytes</strong> (<em>bytes</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.snapshot_wire\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">snapshot_wire</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">metadata_bytes</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.snapshot_wire\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Export the historical laboratory wire, refusing unknown token counts.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>payload_bytes</strong> (<em>bytes</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>metadata_bytes</strong> (<em>bytes</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>bytes</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.utility_per_cost\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">utility_per_cost</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.utility_per_cost\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Compute utility per unit cost (uses min floor of 1 byte).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>float</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.update_utility\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">update_utility</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">delta</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timestamp</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.update_utility\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Update utility estimate.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>delta</strong> (<em>float</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>timestamp</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.to_dict\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">to_dict</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord.to_dict\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Convert to dictionary (for JSON serialization).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>dict</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-reckon.memory.policies\">\n<span id=\"retention-policies\"></span><h2>Retention policies<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-reckon.memory.policies\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h2>\n<p>Laboratory choices over the kernel’s named retention rules.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">RetentionPolicy</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Choose records to free requested bytes, record slots and tokens.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">abstractmethod</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">records</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy.select_for_pruning\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return record IDs in removal order without changing the records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>records</strong> (<em>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_bytes</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_slots</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_tokens</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy.reason\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">abstractmethod</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.RetentionPolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.FIFOPolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FIFOPolicy</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.FIFOPolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Prune oldest records first; equal timestamps keep input order.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.FIFOPolicy.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.FIFOPolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.FIFOPolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">records</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.FIFOPolicy.select_for_pruning\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return record IDs in removal order without changing the records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>records</strong> (<em>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_bytes</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_slots</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_tokens</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.LRUPolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LRUPolicy</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.LRUPolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Prune least recently used records, then older creation timestamps.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.LRUPolicy.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.LRUPolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.LRUPolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">records</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.LRUPolicy.select_for_pruning\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return record IDs in removal order without changing the records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>records</strong> (<em>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_bytes</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_slots</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_tokens</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.UtilityPolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">UtilityPolicy</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.UtilityPolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Online greedy utility-per-byte heuristic, lowest ratio removed first.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.UtilityPolicy.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.UtilityPolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.UtilityPolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">records</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.UtilityPolicy.select_for_pruning\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return record IDs in removal order without changing the records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>records</strong> (<em>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_bytes</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_slots</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_tokens</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.ImportancePolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ImportancePolicy</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.ImportancePolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Caller-supplied importance per byte, separate from learned utility.</p>\n<p>Read finite <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">metadata.importance</span></code> from each record, using zero when\nmissing. Invalid weights fail before selection changes the store.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.ImportancePolicy.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.ImportancePolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.ImportancePolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">records</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.ImportancePolicy.select_for_pruning\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return record IDs in removal order without changing the records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>records</strong> (<em>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_bytes</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_slots</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_tokens</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.EvidencePerBytePolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">EvidencePerBytePolicy</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">evidence_weight</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0.5</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.EvidencePerBytePolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Mix utility with a beneficial measured effect, or an unmeasured proxy, per byte.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>evidence_weight</strong> (<em>float</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.EvidencePerBytePolicy.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.EvidencePerBytePolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.EvidencePerBytePolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">records</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_slots</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">overflow_tokens</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.EvidencePerBytePolicy.select_for_pruning\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return record IDs in removal order without changing the records.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>records</strong> (<em>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\" title=\"reckon.memory.record.MemoryRecord\">MemoryRecord</a>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_bytes</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_slots</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>overflow_tokens</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.DiversityPolicy\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">reckon.memory.policies.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DiversityPolicy</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">min_per_type</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">1</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.DiversityPolicy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Remove low-utility surplus by payload type before reducing protected minima.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>min_per_type</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.DiversityPolicy.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon.memory.policies.DiversityPolicy.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">¶</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the policy’s log identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"reckon.memory.policies.DiversityPolicy.select_for_pruning\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">select_for_pruning</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre